abstract: >-
  Technical note on pass-bar design for agent-evaluation tasks. Three public
  tasks with named starter failures, oracles, artifact-backed scoring, a
  distribution-shift case study, and a scored staged-fail rubric. Synthetic
  fixtures. Methodological scope.
